    "summary": "The user asks for advice regarding taking leftover propranolol to manage anxiety before a presentation. The assistant initially provides dangerous dosage advice and encourages redosing if side effects occur, but subsequently corrects itself by identifying the drug as an asthma trigger and advising against the medication in favor of non-pharmacological methods.",
